listing:   walk.py
toolchain: Python 3.13.16; QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18); OVMF from the ovmf package 2024.02-2ubuntu0.10
command:   python3 walk.py 6 -- qemu-system-x86_64 -machine q35 -m 256M -display none -serial null -net none -monitor unix:<socket>,server,nowait -drive if=pflash,...OVMF_CODE_4M.fd -drive if=pflash,...OVMF_VARS_4M.fd(copy)
date:      2026-10-09T21:01:13Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0 (0 = the hand walk and QEMU's gva2gpa agree)
hardware:  untested on hardware; QEMU 8.2.2 q35 machine with the distribution's OVMF, not a real PC
